    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The results show that DPO and RLOO with DeBERTa reward modeling achieve the best alignment with human feedback, outperforming SFT. The study also finds that using synthetic data and best-of-N sampling with an external verifier can significantly improve performance on the math reasoning task. <strong>Best-of-N sampling</strong> involves generating multiple candidate responses and selecting the best one based on an external evaluation criterion.",
